The '''Lina Soh Hospital''',<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|lina-soh-hospital|Lina Soh Hospital}}</ref> also known as the '''Lina Soh Medical Center''',<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=news/andor-trivia-guide-week-4|text=Secrets from the Set of ''Andor'' Season 2: Week 4 Trivia}}</ref> was a [[Medcenter|hospital]] on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]<ref name="Stop" /> named after former [[Supreme Chancellor]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] [[Lina Soh]]. One of the premiere medical facilities in [[the galaxy]], it was staffed by the best [[doctor]]s in the [[sector]] and was able to serve the needs of nearly every [[species]].<ref name="Databank" /> By [[1 BBY]], [[Standard year|years]] after the fall of the Republic and the [[Proclamation of the New Order|rise]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], the hospital was still in operation,<ref name="Stop" /> and was directed by Doctor [[Recklaw]].<ref name="WEK">{{Andor|Who Else Knows?}}</ref> A [[Color|gold-colored]] sign in [[Aurebesh]] displayed the name of the hospital.<ref name="Stop" />

That [[Standard year|year]], after being [[Raid on the Galactic Antiquities and Objects of Interest|apprehended]] in his shop [[Galactic Antiquities and Objects of Interest]] by [[Imperial Security Bureau]] [[supervisor]] [[Dedra Meero]], [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel]] [[spymaster]] [[Luthen Rael]] stabbed himself with the intention of allowing his secrets to die with him. Meero ordered for him to be kept alive, and Rael was brought to Lina Soh Hospital in an [[Imperial ambunaut]]. Rael was placed in an apparatus that kept him alive despite his mortal injuries, and Meero seized the floor from the hospital's control for the ISB. Despite this, Rael's rebel associate and adopted daughter [[Kleya Marki]] was able to [[Infiltration of Lina Soh Hospital|infiltrate]] the hospital, disguising herself as a patient and then stealing hospital scrubs to disguise herself as a nurse. Distracting the [[ISB tactical agent|ISB agents]] and [[stormtrooper]]s by rigging an explosion in the landing pads, Marki reached Rael's room and took him off life support, ending his life and preventing the ISB from interrogating or torturing him.<ref name="Stop" />

